  (text "LCD $C020: A0 = C/D (C/D high = command/status).  Strobes /RD and /WR from\nthe CPLD; PHI2 is stretched for LCD cycles.  Check the busy flag (STA0/STA1)\nbefore every access.  Contrast: VEE is the module's on-board negative\nbooster output; VDD-V0 should be about 17.4 V.  Check the backlight series\nresistor against the module's LED forward voltage (150 mA typical).\nBacklight defaults on (CB2 is an input at reset, pulled up)." (at 25.4 143.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 4d11a3d9-e992-4d05-9aec-2263cf3f595d)
  )
)
